('127.492.d.1.C',3,'In a hospital, departments that cooperate to provide smooth patient care demonstrate good:','["delay", "rivalry", "teamwork", "gossip"]'::jsonb,2,'Teamwork improves care.','original'),
('127.492.d.1.C',4,'A positive organizational culture in healthcare tends to improve staff morale and patient:','["delays", "errors", "complaints", "outcomes"]'::jsonb,3,'Culture affects outcomes.','original'),
('127.492.d.1.D',3,'Changes in laws, technology, and the economy are all outside factors that influence healthcare management:','["strategies", "recipes", "games", "clothes"]'::jsonb,0,'External factors.','original'),
('127.492.d.1.D',4,'An aging population increases the demand for services such as long-term care and:','["video games", "home health", "toy sales", "fashion retail"]'::jsonb,1,'Demographics shape demand.','original'),
('127.492.d.1.E',3,'A manager who finds that a coworker is falsifying records should report it, which is an example of ethical workplace:','["delay", "failure", "behavior", "denial"]'::jsonb,2,'Ethical behavior.','original'),
