('127.492.d.2.A',4,'A system in which a patient''s primary care provider coordinates all care and referrals is called a(n):','["open market", "walk-in model", "free-for-all", "gatekeeper model"]'::jsonb,3,'HMOs use gatekeepers.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.B',3,'An ongoing process that uses data to improve patient care and reduce errors is quality:','["improvement", "decoration", "reduction", "loss"]'::jsonb,0,'QI.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.B',4,'A hospital tracks the number of patients who return within 30 days as one measure of care:','["color", "quality", "price", "distance"]'::jsonb,1,'Readmission rates.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.C',3,'Software that stores patient records electronically is an example of health information:','["fashion", "furniture", "technology", "decor"]'::jsonb,2,'HIT.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.C',4,'One barrier to adopting new health information technology in a small clinic is the high initial:','["weather", "color", "noise", "cost"]'::jsonb,3,'Cost.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.D',3,'A payment model in which providers are paid for each procedure or visit they perform is called fee-for-:','["service", "time", "name", "fun"]'::jsonb,0,'Fee-for-service.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.D',4,'A fixed amount paid per patient per month to a provider regardless of how many visits occur is:','["deductible", "capitation", "fee-for-service", "coinsurance"]'::jsonb,1,'Capitation.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.E',3,'Money a hospital earns from patient care is revenue, while money spent on salaries and supplies is an:','["profit", "income", "expense", "asset"]'::jsonb,2,'Revenue vs expense.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.E',4,'A hospital''s income from gifts and grants, not patient care, is classified as:','["depreciation", "operating expense", "salary", "non-operating revenue"]'::jsonb,3,'Donations.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.F',3,'Revenue-cycle management tracks a patient''s account from registration to final:','["payment", "discharge party", "visit schedule only", "supply order"]'::jsonb,0,'RCM.','original'),
('127.492.d.2.F',4,'Denied insurance claims are reviewed and resubmitted as part of the revenue:','["mile", "cycle", "parade", "rate"]'::jsonb,1,'Revenue cycle.','original'),
